{"id":"steam-1203840","steam":1203840,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Whacky Golf","summary":"Battle your friends in a chaotic game of mini-golf with up to 4 players. Whack and steal to get the lowest score you can. Just watch your back!","about":"Welcome to Whacky Golf, the most chaotic mini golf game in the world! \r\n\r\nDon't just whack the ball, whack your friends! Wreck their shots, steal their ball, and throw it right in their face! Do whatever it takes to get the lowest score for the course. \r\n\r\nPlay with up to 4 friends locally or go online for huge whacky chaos! \r\n\r\nThe course is yours, just watch your back... \r\n\r\n\nFeatures\n \r\n\n\r\n•  4 player splitscreen mayhem\r\n•  Online play with up to 16 players (coming soon)\r\n•  The most dangerous mini golf you'll ever play\r\n•  9 hole courses for faster games\r\n•  Full controller support\r\n•  Different courses every time you play\r\n•  Game modifiers to play the way you like\r\n•  Customise your character\r\n•  Drop in or out at any time\r\n•  Steam achievements","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203840/library_600x900.jpg?t=1637263679","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203840/header.jpg?t=1637263679","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203840/library_hero.jpg?t=1637263679","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203840/header.jpg?t=1637263679","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203840/ss_d328f4b6fbaf8c826760b55a781626b7d0759bb9.600x338.jpg?t=1637263679","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203840/ss_d328f4b6fbaf8c826760b55a781626b7d0759bb9.jpg?t=1637263679"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203840/ss_34921c22be62bc779c49c4b1d05184ec9724d827.600x338.jpg?t=1637263